@startuml 05_level2_p4
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #FEF3C7

title PPMP - Level 2 decomposition of 4.0
rectangle "Department Head" as H
rectangle "Budget Reviewer" as B
rectangle "Procurement Reviewer" as R
rectangle "Authorized Approver" as F
usecase "3.0\nPrepare and Submit Department PPMP" as P3
usecase "6.0\nRecord Audit Events and Notifications" as P6
database "D1 Identity and Access\nusers, departments, memberships, roles,\npermissions, role assignments, sessions" as D1
database "D2 Planning Reference Data\nfiscal years, planning groups, owner mappings,\nitems, units, expense objects, annual prices,\nfunds, methods, allocations, workflow templates" as D2
database "D3 PPMP Plans and Versions\nplan identities, version headers,\nversion items, quarterly quantities, snapshots" as D3
database "D4 Private Attachments\nversion-linked metadata and file objects" as D4
database "D5 Review Records\nreview instances, assigned stages,\nappend-only decisions and comments" as D5
usecase "4.1\nCreate Review Instance and Load Packet" as P41
usecase "4.2\nValidate Reviewer, Stage and Decision" as P42
usecase "4.3\nRecord Decision and Update Version State" as P43

P3 --> P41 : F022 Submitted version reference\n[SUBMISSION]
H --> P41 : F023 Review queue / version / attachment request\n[REVIEW_QUERY]
H --> P42 : F024 Endorsement or return with comments\n[HEAD_DECISION]
P41 --> H : F025 Head review packet and action result\n[REVIEW_PACKET]
B --> P41 : F026 Review queue / version / attachment request\n[REVIEW_QUERY]
B --> P42 : F027 Budget findings and decision\n[BUDGET_DECISION]
P41 --> B : F028 Budget review packet and action result\n[REVIEW_PACKET]
R --> P41 : F029 Review queue / version / attachment request\n[REVIEW_QUERY]
R --> P42 : F030 Procurement findings and decision\n[PROC_DECISION]
P41 --> R : F031 Procurement review packet and action result\n[REVIEW_PACKET]
F --> P41 : F032 Review queue / version / attachment request\n[REVIEW_QUERY]
F --> P42 : F033 Approval, return or rejection\n[FINAL_DECISION]
P41 --> F : F034 Approval packet and action result\n[REVIEW_PACKET]
D1 --> P42 : F035 Current reviewer authority and scope\n[ACCESS_RECORDS]
D2 --> P41 : F036 Workflow templates and budget context\n[REFERENCE]
D3 --> P41 : F037 Submitted content and effective version\n[PLAN_READ]
D4 --> P41 : F038 Submitted attachment records and bytes\n[ATTACH_READ]
D5 --> P41 : F039 Existing stages, comments and decisions\n[REVIEW_READ]
P43 --> D5 : F040 Review assignments, decisions and comments\n[REVIEW_WRITE]
P43 --> D3 : F041 Version state and effective approved version\n[PLAN_STATE_WRITE]
P43 --> P6 : F063 Process 4.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P41 --> P42 : 4.01 Version, workflow and authority context\n[REVIEW_CONTEXT]
P42 --> P43 : 4.02 Validated decision\n[VALID_DECISION]
P43 --> P41 : 4.03 Updated stage and decision receipt\n[REVIEW_PACKET]
P41 --> P43 : 4.04 Initial review instance and stage assignment\n[REVIEW_WRITE]
P42 --> P41 : 4.05 Decision validation result\n[REVIEW_PACKET]
P41 --> P42 : 4.06 Packet access request\n[REVIEW_QUERY]
P42 --> P41 : 4.07 Authorized reviewer scope or denial\n[REVIEW_ACCESS]
legend bottom
Rectangle = external role; oval = data-transforming process
Cylinder = logical data store; arrow = named data payload
U groups all roles for shared login, reports and inbox functions.
Numbered process peers in Level 2 are outside the decomposed process.
Packet fields: FLOW_REGISTER.md; relationships: DATA_DICTIONARY.md
endlegend
@enduml
